{'symbol': 'ALLE', 'date': '2022-09-01 17:00:00', 'title': 'ALLEGION DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'DUBLIN--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ALLEGION PLC (NYSE: ALLE), A LEADING GLOBAL SECURITY PRODUCTS AND SOLUTIONS PROVIDER, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.41 PER ORDINARY SHARE OF THE COMPANY. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON SEPT. 30, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON SEPT. 16, 2022. FORWARD-LOOKING STATEMENTS THIS PRESS RELEASE CONTAINS "FORWARD-LOOKING STATEMENTS" WITHIN THE MEANING OF THE PRIVATE SECURITIES LITIGATION REFORM ACT OF 1995, SECTION 27A OF THE SEC'}